🧭 Project Style Guide
1. Purpose

This document defines the visual, structural, and coding standards for the project to ensure consistency across all components, pages, and features.
It serves as a reference for developers, designers, and contributors working on this repository.

2. Design Principles

Consistency: Maintain uniform spacing, typography, and color usage across the application.

Clarity: Every visual element and line of code should serve a clear purpose.

Accessibility: Follow WCAG AA accessibility guidelines wherever possible.

Scalability: Ensure components are reusable and easily extendable.

3. Color Palette
Color Name	Usage	Hex Code
Primary	Buttons, Highlights	#3B82F6
Secondary	Subtle accents	#9333EA
Background	Page backgrounds	#FFFFFF
